## Interface: 30300
## Title: Retail Professions
## Notes: A retail-style profession window: search, filters, skill-up odds, unlearned recipes and where to learn them, a recipe tracker, Mill All and Prospect All, multicraft and resourcefulness odds with a proc log, a professions book (K), a craft-for-profit view priced from the auction house and a Home tab with what to do next (following the wow-professions.com leveling guides) and the most profitable crafts across every profession. Backed by the mod-retail-professions server module.
